```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Jenni Update Received] --> B[Record in delivery_provider_sync_events]
    B --> C{Duplicate?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Skip - return ok]
    C -->|No| E[Find matching order]
    E --> F{Order found?}
    F -->|No| G[⚠️ Log warning - orphan update]
    F -->|Yes| H[Map Jenni status → DeliveryStatus]
    H --> I{Amount changed?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Flag for admin review + insert delivery_event]
    I -->|No| K[Update order_delivery_integrations]
